{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14235","headline":"途中立春寄杨郇伯 · 窦常","name":"途中立春寄杨郇伯","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浪迹终年客，惊心此地春。\n风前独去马，泽畔耦耕人。\n老大交情重，悲凉外物亲。\n子云今在宅，应见柳条新。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦常","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14235.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14235","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}